<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">XORTX THERAPEUTICS INC.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">For the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:1pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Expressed in U.S. Dollars)</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_mNOp3AP2qEaUdGWyYBWD4w" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory" id="Tb_OVf5orsQyEeUdlim0LEm9Q" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">19.</b></span>Subsequent event</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On October 15, 2025, the Company entered into a binding term sheet (the &#8220;Term Sheet&#8221;) to acquire a Renal Anti-Fibrotic Therapeutic Program from Vectus Biosystems Limited, an Australian Securities Exchange listed company (&#8220;Vectus&#8221;). The program includes a novel new chemical entity, VB4-P5, along with its associated intellectual property, regulatory documentation, and manufacturing data. The Term Sheet provides for the Company to acquire from Vectus the intellectual property specifically related to the VB4-P5 compound and the data generated by Vectus from its work on the VB4-P5 small molecule and related assets. The consideration receivable by Vectus is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dzuO8XRtsEKkirlJluyEEQ" contextRef="Duration_10_15_2025_To_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_4akcwis0xUiRCZgzGkzujw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:IfrsAssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_SvfLknwqzEOzDZOuqPOSHQ">3,000,000</ix:nonFraction>, payable in common shares of the Company at a deemed issue price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_EmGIqsV4PUyGPzDdfRCGbA" contextRef="As_Of_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_-62Rj9KlSki83glzf86Yfw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:AssetAcquisitionPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_yD5nEqO0dkaCbySn90allw">0.86</ix:nonFraction> per common share (the &#8220;Issue Price&#8221;), with the Issue Price subject to adjustment in certain circumstances. The Company has agreed to pay a cash finders&#8217; fee of the greater of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_fVU-ieDRm0-FWriGutn5zA" contextRef="Duration_10_15_2025_To_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_4akcwis0xUiRCZgzGkzujw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:CashFinderFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_drgY1rgZIEGk8gl-eoXcKw">5</ix:nonFraction>% of the transaction value or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dzuO8XRtsEKkirlJluyEEQ" contextRef="Duration_10_15_2025_To_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_4akcwis0xUiRCZgzGkzujw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:CashFinderFeeAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_JiFUSoxmU025F4XM8AKUzw">250,000</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Term Sheet is subject to finalization of closing documentation, satisfaction of conditions that are typical for a transaction of this type including receipt of all regulatory approvals, and compliance with applicable stock exchange requirements and applicable securities laws. Closing of the acquisition will occur no more than <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_10_15_2025_To_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_4akcwis0xUiRCZgzGkzujw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="xrtx:AssetAcquisitionTermFromExecutionOfAgreement" id="Narr_rErRfzFWiUytne5u1XPzEQ">90 days</ix:nonNumeric> from the execution of the Term Sheet. If the Term Sheet is terminated or closing does not occur, other than as a result of a breach of the Term Sheet by Vectus, then the Company shall issue to Vectus $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dzuO8XRtsEKkirlJluyEEQ" contextRef="Duration_10_15_2025_To_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_4akcwis0xUiRCZgzGkzujw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:AssetAcquisitionTerminationFees" scale="0" id="Narr_UOk71Kf4OUmQ5d7gkfHEgA">50,000</ix:nonFraction> of common shares at the Issue Price.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to the binding term sheet that was entered into between XORTX and Vectus, closing is to occur no later than <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_10_15_2025_To_10_15_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_4akcwis0xUiRCZgzGkzujw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="xrtx:AssetAcquisitionTermFromExecutionOfAgreement" id="Narr_CSzbrJkQxk-MVsfHNr_xew">90 days</ix:nonNumeric> post signing, being January 13, 2026. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 13, 2026, the Company entered into an extension agreement with Vectus to extend the closing date to March 31, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2025, the Company had incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dzuO8XRtsEKkirlJluyEEQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_EwtZ27PgDEetHsjpOvXZMw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:DeferredAcquisitionCosts" scale="0" id="Narr_S6eF7Ksm7U2olfQwZTtrqA">293,803</ix:nonFraction> of deferred acquisition costs in connection with this transaction, which includes $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dzuO8XRtsEKkirlJluyEEQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_xrtx_IfrsAssetAcquisitionAxis_xrtx_RenalAntiFibroticTherapeuticProgramMember_EwtZ27PgDEetHsjpOvXZMw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrtx:DeferredCashFinderFees" scale="0" id="Narr_5XlkP1AdY0S5SYWMgGqrbA">200,000</ix:nonFraction> towards the finders&#8217; fee.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On February 4, 2026, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_eIeK2L9JMEmKGdsDN_mzuA" contextRef="Duration_2_4_2026_To_2_4_2026_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_xrtx_IfrsDirectorMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_S8wc1CNMwEaZUpRIAIzMWQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfShareOptionsGrantedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" scale="0" id="Narr_VMFQ4pxTOUae0c_Ewi9Row">20,000</ix:nonFraction> options to purchase common shares of the Company to a director. The options are exercisable at a price of CAD $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_CAD_shares_t7sXNR8RvU2SoFNp0TvDgQ" contextRef="Duration_2_4_2026_To_2_4_2026_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_xrtx_IfrsDirectorMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_S8wc1CNMwEaZUpRIAIzMWQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ExercisePriceShareOptionsGranted2019" scale="0" id="Narr_DhlIPw36Ck6d-aKVmKL-vw">0.69</ix:nonFraction> per common share and expire <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_9C40Cv1Yw02QE0LuOyaylQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">five years</span></span> from the date of grant.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-32</p></div></div>
